=== INFO ===
1. Add a custom font to this site.
2. Give your museum a name.
3. Collect 10 links from the internet on a specific topic. Add thumbnails and a title for each link.

The header should be a flexbox with centered content.

The links div should be a grid that changes columns depending on screen size.

Each link should be a vertical flexbox.

Do a deep-dive on [Are.na](https://www.are.na/) to find links!
